{"strongs": "H3169", "word": "חִזְקִיָּ֫הוּ", "translit": "ye.chiz.qiy.yah", "root": "חזז", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "hath strengthened", "definition": "חִזְקִיָּ֫הוּ , חִזְקִיָּה , יְחִזְקִיָּהוּ , יְחִזְקִיָּה proper name, masculine ( ׳ י hath strengthened , ׳ י stengtheneth ; = Assyrian –aza‡i \\ \\ \\ ( i ) au , Schr COT on 2Kgs 18:1 ff., Jäger BAS i, 469 ; compare proper name יחזק on seal Gann JAs 1883 Feb. — Mar., 134 No. 7 ; — on formative see Lag BN 134 ) — 1. ᵐ5 Εξεκιας , son of Ahaz , King of Judah, seldom חִזְקִיָּה 2Kgs 18:1 ; 2Kgs 18:10 ; 2Kgs 18:14 (twice in verse); 2Kgs 18:15 ; 2Kgs 18:16 (twice in verse), also ׳ אַנְשֵׁי ח Prov 25:1 ; elsewhere in 2 Kings (except Prov 20:10 ) חִזְקִיָּהוּ : Prov 16:20 ; Prov 18:9 + 34 t., 2 Ki 18-21 || Isa 36:1 + 31 t., Isa 36-39; also Jer 26:18 ; Jer 26:19 ; 1Chr 3:13 ; 2Chr 29:18 ; 2Chr 29:27 ; 2Chr 30:24 ; 2Chr 32:15 in Chronicles use. יְחִזְקִיָּחוּ 1Chr 4:41 ; 2Chr 28:27 + 35 t. 2 Chron 29-33; also 2Kgs 20:10 ; Jer 15:4 , and in title Isa 1:1 יִחִזְקִיָה Hos 1:1 ; Mic 1:1 (if י in these three be not text error for וְ ). 2. חִזְקִיָּה great-great-grandfather of prophet Zephaniah Zeph 1:1 , ᵐ5 τοῦ Εξεκιου, perhaps = 1. 3. ᵐ5 Εξεκια ( ς ) , חִזְקִיָּה man of royal Davidic line 1Chr 3:23 probably near time of Char. 4. יְחִזְקִיָּה , ᵐ5 Εξεκια ( ς ) , head of a family of returned exiles Ezra 2:16 = חִזְקִיָּה Neh 7:21 , compare also ׳ ח Neh 10:18 . 5. יְחִזְקִיָּהוּ ᵐ5 Εξεκιας, an Ephraimite, Ahaz's time 2Chr 28:12 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2688')\">BDB2688</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2396')\">H2396</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3169')\">H3169</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2687')\">BDB2687</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2689')\">BDB2689</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חִזְקִיָּ֫הוּ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>חִזְקִיָּה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יְחִזְקִיָּהוּ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יְחִזְקִיָּה</bdbheb> <b>proper name,